WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 27514542de5bb8b50d4feb7981d39180

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.000
Karibu kwenye Misingi ya Kupanga Programu. Baada ya dakika moja,

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.380
nitakupeleka moja kwa moja kwenye zoezi lako la kwanza,

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.150
lakini kwanza, nataka kueleza kwa haraka jinsi

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:11.310
sehemu hii ya jukwaa inavyofanya kazi. Katika kozi hii,

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.940
nitakufundisha jinsi kupanga programu kunavyofanya kazi

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.720
hatua kwa hatua. Nimegawanya mambo

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:19.260
katika dhana nyingi ndogo ndogo ambazo

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.940
tutaziunganisha kadiri kozi inavyoendelea. Ninaitambulisha

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.190
kila dhana katika video kama hii,

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.410
ambapo ninakuelekeza katika misingi ya

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:30.520
dhana hiyo, nikiwa na Jiki kama msaidizi wangu. Nitakueleza

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:34.220
zaidi kumhusu baadaye. Ukishatazama video,

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.300
utafungua ukurasa maalum wa dhana ambapo

00:00:37.340 --> 00:00:39.840
unaweza kurudi na kusoma kuhusu dhana hiyo

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:43.100
wakati wowote unapohitaji kujikumbusha. Baada ya

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:45.200
kila video, nitakupa zoezi la

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:48.000
kuitumia dhana hiyo kwa vitendo, kisha mara nyingi

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.000
mazoezi machache ambapo unaweza kuunganisha

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:53.540
dhana mpya na dhana nyingine zote

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.940
ambazo tayari umejifunza. Mwanzoni, unapojua

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.000
dhana chache tu za msingi, mazoezi

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:02.960
yataonekana rahisi kiasi, labda hata

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.920
rahisi kupita kiasi. Lakini kadiri unavyojifunza

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:09.800
mambo mengi zaidi, kiwango cha ugumu kitaongezeka. Tuna

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.360
mambo kadhaa ya kukusaidia kukabiliana na

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:15.100
kiwango hicho cha ugumu. Kwanza, kila zoezi lina vidokezo

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:16.979
unavyoweza kutumia ukikwama.

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:19.170
Nataka utumie

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:21.600
vidokezo tu baada ya kutumia muda wa kutosha

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:25.190
ukijaribu kutatua tatizo mwenyewe. Lakini

00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:26.960
ukikwama na huwezi kusonga mbele,

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:29.040
kutakuwa na kidokezo unachoweza kufungua

00:01:29.060 --> 00:01:32.840
kikusaidie. Pili, ukikwama,

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:35.480
unaweza kutumia Uliza Jiki, msaada wetu wa AI.

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.580
Unaweza kueleza mahali ulipochanganyikiwa au kukwama,

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:44.120
nao utakusaidia kuendelea. Tatu, mazoezi

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:47.350
mengi yana video za uchambuzi wa kina, na ninaongeza

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:50.170
zaidi kila wakati. Katika

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.960
video hizi za uchambuzi wa kina, ninatatua zoezi mwenyewe,

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:55.770
nikieleza jinsi ya kulifikiria tatizo

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.320
na mara nyingi nikieleza kwa undani zaidi

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:01.220
dhana za kupanga programu unazozipata katika

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:05.270
video hizi fupi za kufundishia. Ninapendekeza sana uzitazame

00:02:05.320 --> 00:02:07.730
video hizi. Tulipoendesha kozi hii kama

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.650
kambi ya mafunzo, watu waliniambia kuwa vipindi hivi

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:12.520
vya uchambuzi wa kina vilikuwa sehemu yenye manufaa zaidi

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:15.080
ya kambi nzima ya mafunzo. Ukikwama

00:02:15.220 --> 00:02:18.120
katikati ya zoezi, unaweza kuchungulia video ya uchambuzi

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:20.840
wa kina, lakini ningependekeza usimame

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:22.600
mara tu unapofika kwenye sehemu

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:25.160
ulipokwama, kisha ujaribu

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.460
kuendelea kutatua zoezi kutoka hapo mwenyewe.

00:02:29.020 --> 00:02:31.800
Sawa. Hivyo ndivyo mambo yanavyofanya kazi. Sasa utaenda

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:34.340
kujaribu zoezi lako la kwanza ambapo

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:36.700
utatatua mzingile. Huhitaji kujua

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:39.820
chochote kuhusu kupanga programu ili kufanya hivyo.

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:41.800
Katika mazoezi yote, kuna

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:43.840
maelezo mengi upande wa kulia wa

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:47.420
skrini ili uyasome. Anza hapo kila mara.

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:50.000
Ukishayasoma, andika maagizo yako

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.860
kwa kompyuta upande wa kushoto wa

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:54.180
skrini, kisha bonyeza kitufe cha Endesha Msimbo

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:56.920
ili kompyuta ifuate maagizo

00:02:56.980 --> 00:03:01.340
hayo. Ukishatatua zoezi, rudi

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:03.380
kwa video inayofuata nami nitakueleza

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:06.440
kidogo kuhusu maagizo hayo hasa ni nini

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:08.960
na kinachoendelea nyuma ya pazia. Kila

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.860
la heri, na tutaonana tena hapa

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:11.210
hivi karibuni.
